    <section class="of-project" id="featuredProject"><div class="of-project__inner"><div class="of-project__image-col"><img src="/images/ch-case-study.jpg" alt="Historic North Philadelphia AME church fellowship hall with 3M Thinsulate window film" title="Historic North Philadelphia AME church fellowship hall with 3M Thinsulate window film" class="of-project__img" width="848" height="1264" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="of-project__stats-strip"><div class="of-project__stat"><span class="of-project__stat-num">1</span><span class="of-project__stat-label">Film Solution</span></div><div class="of-project__stat-div"></div><div class="of-project__stat"><span class="of-project__stat-num">75</span><span class="of-project__stat-label">Thinsulate VLT</span></div><div class="of-project__stat-div"></div><div class="of-project__stat"><span class="of-project__stat-num">0</span><span class="of-project__stat-label">Service Disruptions</span></div><div class="of-project__stat-div"></div><div class="of-project__stat"><span class="of-project__stat-num">Year-Round</span><span class="of-project__stat-label">Comfort</span></div></div></div><div class="of-project__text-col"><div class="of-project__eyebrow">North Philadelphia — Historic AME Church</div><h2 class="of-project__title">How a Historic North Philadelphia Church Made Its Fellowship Hall Comfortable Year-Round</h2><div class="of-project__detail"><span class="of-project__detail-label">Challenge</span><span class="of-project__detail-val">Large single-pane clear glass windows in the fellowship hall caused intense summer heat gain, uncomfortable warm-weather events, elevated winter heat loss, and limited options under a modest operational budget.</span></div><div class="of-project__detail"><span class="of-project__detail-label">Solution</span><span class="of-project__detail-val">3M Thinsulate Climate Control CC75 window film on fellowship hall windows, improving both summer solar rejection and winter insulation through a